rn130740product11\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n1\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn130740product11\",\"UGREEN NASync DXP4800 Plus 4-Bay NAS Enclosure\"]\ue201\n\n(Best overall hardware value)\n\n## \\$619.99\n\nIntel Pentium Gold 8505, 10GbE, 4 bays, NVMe slots. Excellent for Plex, Docker and fast file transfers. Software is less mature than Synology DSM.\n\nSeller: B&amp;H Photo\n\n\ue200url\ue202View product\ue202https://www.bhphotovideo.com/c/product/1834643-REG/ugreen_35260_dxp4800plus_8505.html?BI=23971&kw=UG35260&utm_medium=feed&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn130740product9\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n2\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn130740product9\",\"Synology DiskStation DS925+ 4-Bay Diskless NAS\"]\ue201\n\n**Best for backups and family photos**\n\n## \\$711.99\n\nExcellent DSM software, Synology Photos, snapshots and easy backup management. AMD CPU lacks hardware video transcoding.\n\nSeller: Micro Center\n\n\ue200url\ue202View product\ue202https://www.microcenter.com/product/698130/synology-diskstation-ds925-4-bay-diskless-nas?utm_medium=feed&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn130740product10\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n3\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn130740product10\",\"TerraMaster F4-425 4-Bay NAS Home Network Storage\"]\ue201\n\n**Best budget 4-bay**\n\n## \\$429.99\n\nFour bays, Intel processor and 2.5GbE networking at a lower entry price. Good for basic home storage and media.\n\nSeller: B&amp;H Photo\n\n\ue200url\ue202View product\ue202https://www.bhphotovideo.com/c/product/1929001-REG/terramaster_f4_425_4_bay_home_network_storage.html?BI=23971&kw=TEF4425&utm_medium=feed&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn130740product0\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n4\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn130740product0\",\"QNAP TS-464 4-Bay NAS Enclosure\"]\ue201\n\n**Best for advanced configuration**\n\n## \\$639.00\n\nIntel Celeron, dual 2.5GbE, PCIe expansion and a broad application ecosystem. Flexible but older hardware.\n\nSeller: B&amp;H Photo"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/recoveryDiagnostics/0/code","o":"replace","v":"unterminated_tag"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/recoveryDiagnostics/0/line","o":"replace","v":56},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/recoveryDiagnostics/0/column","o":"replace","v":7}],"c":11}

